  "properties": {
    "title": "Digitizing the french railway network - an open source endeavour",
    "description": "From detecting vegetation hazard to measuring catenary geometry, it all begins with **three trains equipped with LiDaR** mapping systems, roaming the french railway network.\r\n\r\nLet us see how **geospatial opensource softwares** enabled us to build a cost-effective and comprehensive solution, starting from basic raw data processing up to setting up a geographic information system, full of relevant data that **brings up railway maintenance to another level**.",
